schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-env-resonance-core
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Resonance Core — Zone 6 of the Twilight Zone. A vast
    industrial engine room of impossible scale, the machinery that keeps the boundary between
    worlds intact — or perhaps the machinery that is tearing it apart. Massive gears and
    pistons made of solidified shadow fill the space, their surfaces absorbing light rather
    than reflecting it. Steam — or something like steam, but darker, heavier — rises from
    joints and vents throughout the chamber. Molten copper seams run through the shadow-metal
    machinery, glowing white-hot at stress points and cooling to deep amber in the troughs,
    providing the primary illumination. The copper veins pulse with rhythmic intensity, like
    a heartbeat. Walkways and catwalks of rusted iron spiral around the central mechanism —
    a massive rotating cylinder of shadow and copper that extends beyond sight in both
    directions, up into darkness and down into darkness. Pressure gauges read in alchemical
    symbols rather than numbers. Pipes and conduits carry the molten copper through the
    shadow machinery. The scale is overwhelming — the player would be insect-small against
    these mechanisms. The lighting is industrial: white-hot copper, deep amber cooling,
    and absolute shadow where the copper light cannot reach. Painterly style, dramatic
    industrial atmosphere. The mood is the machinery of reality itself, vast and indifferent.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, clean factory, modern industrial, colorful palette, steampunk whimsy, brass brightness, low detail, flat shading, human scale"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

tags: [environment, zone-6, industrial, engine, machinery, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
